    {
      "text": "driven me out this day from the face of the earth, Gen. 4:14 (Moses 5:39). I have seen God face to face, Gen. 32:30 (Moses 1:2, 11). Lord spake unto Moses face to face, Ex. 33:11 (Moses 1:31). skin of his face shone, Ex. 34:29. set my face against that soul that eateth, Lev. 17:10. Lord make his face shine upon thee, Num. 6:25. thou Lord art seen face to face, Num. 14:14. Lord talked with you face to face in the mount, Deut. 5:4. I will hide my face from them, Deut. 31:17. Moses, whom the Lord knew face to face, Deut. 34:10. seen an angel … face to face, Judg. 6:22. seek his face continually, 1 Chr. 16:11 (Ps. 105:4; D&C 101:38). If my people … seek my face, 2 Chr. 7:14. Thy face, Lord, will I seek, Ps. 27:8. Make thy face to shine upon thy servant, Ps. 31:16 (119:135). face of the Lord is against them that do evil, Ps. 34:16 (1 Pet. 3:12). As in water face answereth to face, Prov. 27:19. man’s wisdom maketh his face to shine, Eccl. 8:1. Lord, that hideth his face, Isa. 8:17. your sins have hid his face from you, Isa. 59:2. plead with you face to face, Ezek. 20:35. his face as the appearance of lightning, Dan. 10:6. acknowledge their offence, and seek my face, Hosea 5:15. all faces shall gather blackness, Joel 2:6.",
